/// Holds every measure of the model. It is a calculated table that names no other table.
table _Measures

	column Placeholder
		isHidden
		isNameInferred
		sourceColumn: [Placeholder]

	partition _Measures = calculated
		mode: import
		source = ROW ( "Placeholder", BLANK () )

	annotation CalculatedReason = The model reads its data in Direct Lake or DirectQuery mode. An entered table would add an imported table, so the measures table is a calculated table that names no other table (model standard, rule 1).
